      </p>
    </header>

    <div class="prose prose-rose dark:prose-invert max-w-none text-sm sm:text-base space-y-8 text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">
      
      <!-- Section 1: The 4 Computational Pillars -->
      <section class="space-y-4">
        <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white">
          1. The 4 Scientific &amp; Mathematical Pillars of Love Testing
        </h2>
        <p>
          High-accuracy compatibility engines evaluate romantic synergy across four interconnected disciplines:
        </p>
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-4 not-prose my-4">
          <div class="p-5 rounded-2xl border border-rose-200 dark:border-rose-800 bg-white/70 dark:bg-slate-900/70">
            <h3 class="font-bold text-base text-rose-600 dark:text-rose-400 flex items-center gap-2">
              <span>🔤 Acoustic Phonetics &amp; Gematria</span>
            </h3>
            <p class="text-xs text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300 mt-2 leading-relaxed">
              Evaluating the phonetic cadence, consonant-to-vowel ratios, and alphanumeric vibrational weights of both partner names using Pythagorean reduction.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="p-5 rounded-2xl border border-rose-200 dark:border-rose-800 bg-white/70 dark:bg-slate-900/70">
            <h3 class="font-bold text-base text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-400 flex items-center gap-2">
              <span>🪐 Astrological Synastry &amp; Ephemeris</span>
            </h3>
            <p class="text-xs text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300 mt-2 leading-relaxed">
              Mapping planetary angles (trines, sextiles, squares, oppositions) based on celestial coordinates verified by NASA JPL planetary ephemeris tables.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="p-5 rounded-2xl border border-rose-200 dark:border-rose-800 bg-white/70 dark:bg-slate-900/70">
