                <td class="p-2.5 font-mono font-bold">G, P, Y</td>
                <td class="p-2.5">Spiritual depth, intellectual intimacy, intuitive telepathy</td>
                <td class="p-2.5 text-center font-bold">1, 5, 7</td>
              </tr>
              <tr class="bg-rose-50/40 dark:bg-slate-800/40">
