          <li><strong>Attachment Theory (Bowlby &amp; Ainsworth):</strong> Evaluating how Secure, Anxious, and Avoidant attachment styles interact during conflict and intimacy.</li>
          <li><strong>Gottman Emotional Bids:</strong> The frequency with which partners turn toward each other's emotional requests versus turning away.</li>
          <li><strong>Chapman's 5 Love Languages:</strong> Words of Affirmation, Quality Time, Receiving Gifts, Acts of Service, and Physical Touch.</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <!-- Section 4: Privacy & Client-Side Execution -->
      <section class="space-y-4">
        <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white">
